        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "半决赛，首盘的终点，一次次被推远。前十个盘点都没拿下，莱巴金娜等到了第十一次。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "e901bc85a32cf7c8806799126c1fae9472d9a821a7d1075c2e97b705b03a83ad",
      "words_sha256": "fe77e84fd1a1dbeb90f1ce56a99e40b1c31791a29f85f8269098399ce5b50e63"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:7300c1a56ca96d393c87bf2053a55c40e4f4cc35daa475aae9456ded50a2f0ef",
      "request_id": "7300c1a56ca96d393c87bf2053a55c40e4f4cc35daa475aae9456ded50a2f0ef",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "02205262b0898d1aafe0e301eeaf3bde",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "第二盘五比四，轮到自己发球结束比赛，她却连丢四分，被追到五比五。但她随即破发，又把机会争了回来。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "0e988697b1a131bd24bba8366d6f8226d008c665dd82ace49b1a18fa94cf7380",
      "words_sha256": "b4fd639b38f197c53bfba4c7f4c4c942733d0d783cf0de18bb2e6fb58eaf7b4c"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:7c1669ce05c286b766c8d7ebf107bd885fb8663090ca9e39075d8d80831b7fea",
      "request_id": "7c1669ce05c286b766c8d7ebf107bd885fb8663090ca9e39075d8d80831b7fea",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "1389acb5d587bd58abeab11bf76c0944",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "制胜分二十五比十，非受迫失误二十五比二十四。她拿下对手四个发球局，也把自己的发球局，一个都守住了。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "e7c794ffb1df3a8221b7963aa4e0f9f85d194c93edfce401f82c609945e85279",
      "words_sha256": "9fa49414ac439634a2584064d938e2621c9057328d85ffa605bca44e519a0d49"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:8eff5f0be72f548642bbbccef262ffd1602ad3e49b34fd044dfd25cc551d1114",
      "request_id": "8eff5f0be72f548642bbbccef262ffd1602ad3e49b34fd044dfd25cc551d1114",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "ced27fce0081d430c7906663c57dc38b",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "从中途失速，到收官反复，莱巴金娜还是把宁波冠军留下了。赛季第四冠，生涯第十五冠。到了年终总决赛，你看好她走到哪一步？",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "82454fe609186b947f6b0463cd483636f75f082d125a40cdfe01e2fc608c54fb",
      "words_sha256": "893c0d6417856dd158b5276264ec7f1b4b17a575e88cbdedfd4ab7983ce297ce"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:a8ed7c249aecc8b48ad05e87b27351aec94389a4f2af1b915a9f37e1140e0ee5",
      "request_id": "a8ed7c249aecc8b48ad05e87b27351aec94389a4f2af1b915a9f37e1140e0ee5",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "cfdf13b47d1656121792e25af6d18553",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "北京时间十月二十五日下午，宁波站女单决赛。北京首战出局，武汉因伤退赛。莱巴金娜在这里，把去年的冠军守住了。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "87d727fcdd2a2d188ea5ea373d25af59fcfd6ba5c8ebd2c64eb4e22f0c8a2d25",
      "words_sha256": "0af81491a56b29179fef944e43b839302286edb265b723cd437a8d82dcd557a3"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:b1a5b8477181f41c0dde54f4c6fffc39b9376a3198b3952b6d24c71387f4cdf0",
      "request_id": "b1a5b8477181f41c0dde54f4c6fffc39b9376a3198b3952b6d24c71387f4cdf0",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "8271bfc266dc0a464a4403e991bcd74d",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "对阵卡瓦，首盘六比一，第二盘却有二十一次非受迫失误。盘点上，莱巴金娜在底线被拉向左侧，伸拍救球，还是丢掉了这一盘。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "0fff73a746e91552e48970ef16fab5fc3c840f05c3729848ed8d96c49bf091bd",
      "words_sha256": "05efa3fd5ea18ec377c492d1f1493c8cb460e9ce8186e29482206febd6810a2a"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:b80ad40cf03e2a1bf0849f74b5dd89f9591e3dfac6354816bf5cd093c739d31d",
      "request_id": "b80ad40cf03e2a1bf0849f74b5dd89f9591e3dfac6354816bf5cd093c739d31d",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "20da8f5468902afbbecb78daefb15d83",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "关注网球时插，时插归我，好球归你。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "3d7277d26afc569ab1979d3485891d79e290c7f020c7ffccb0a9e1a2d11c811f",
      "words_sha256": "ffd92401e4e51d044cd0ba811dd56c27dfa59f0de4734ee872348e09ba3401b8"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:c08907b6bf5aa6d346340d2b977dcbb4070a4006e1a49b1b575644d0bedbcb4a",
      "request_id": "c08907b6bf5aa6d346340d2b977dcbb4070a4006e1a49b1b575644d0bedbcb4a",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "865562388b0c0ecfb5223bb10758b940",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "决赛，对面是费尔南德斯。首盘盘点，莱巴金娜发球后继续在底线相持，调动对手左右奔跑。赢下这一分，她就先拿一盘。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "d8a2cff9a9c3c4b95acb256b108c9042be7c7999ac7f4a5289fdfbed79a85e78",
      "words_sha256": "6ea0ab3cccb16f440f8179967d7d4813175f9b812253ac3b1aada7d9347959e0"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:c2f0a0d62bc4c0694e27886dd2387f3f3691a660ac381d8eb0081c442b79c4a3",
      "request_id": "c2f0a0d62bc4c0694e27886dd2387f3f3691a660ac381d8eb0081c442b79c4a3",
